| HI    | Etymology            | Historical provenance                            |
| ME    | Lexicology           | Vocabulary classification                        |
| ME    | Semantics            | Meaning and interpretation                       |
| ME    | Syntax               | Grammatical relationships                        |
| ME    | Pragmatics           | Contextual meaning                               |
| LO    | Discourse Analysis   | Communication structure                          |
| LO    | Sociolinguistics     | Social language relationships                    |
| LO    | Psycholinguistics    | Language-processing cognition                    |
| LO    | Metalinguistics      | Language about language                          |
